i lottare","overview":"Greg, un agente sotto copertura, e Myriam, un'attivista ambientale, si incontrano a uno ZAD e si innamorano. Diviso tra le sue ambizioni professionali e una storia d'amore, l'agente deve prendere una decisione difficile che potrebbe cambiare tutto."},{"language":"en-US","title":"A Place to Fight For","overview":"Greg is a police lieutenant; he must collect informations on eco-activists, infiltrating them for months. Myriam, a young free woman, is fighting to save a forest from the building of a dam. They meet and fall in love on the Zone. A beautiful life, a joy that Greg discovers, despite the risks of being unmasked. For each of them, time is short: soon everything will disappear.","tagline":"A WORLD TO PROTECT, A LOVE TO SAVE"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Greg, officier de la DGSI, est envoyé sous une fausse identité pour infiltrer une ZAD. Il y rencontre Myriam, une militante écologiste. 18 mois plus tard, Greg retourne sur place pour une mission officielle, il retrouve Myriam et découvre qu’elle a un bébé. Déchiré entre son ambition professionnelle et un amour naissant, Greg doit faire un choix, qui peut tout changer. Car le temps presse, bientôt tout disparaîtra.","tagline":"Un monde à protéger, un amour à sauver."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/32ft164l7HdkO4EnYkSOREPSL9j.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3LzSMuatf6E6xw6i9F8LnvBZmAy.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":988762,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/32ft164l7HdkO4EnYkSOREPSL9j.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/32ft164l7HdkO4EnYkSOREPSL9j.jpg","language":"it","width":510,"height":765},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/32ft164l7HdkO4EnYkSOREPSL9j.jpg